cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results, cite them via this metadata."
title: "Hadamard-M: an erratum at order 515, and an explicit Hadamard matrix of order 7796"
abstract: >-
  An erratum on Miyamoto's 1991 construction at order 515, the only claim in
  the literature at Hadamard order 2060: a parity obstruction shows the
  paper's Corollary 4 cannot supply the order-103 ingredient the entry needs.
  The same paper's main theorem, applied to a publicly announced Hadamard
  matrix of order 1948, gives an explicit Hadamard matrix of order 7796,
  verified in exact integer arithmetic. AI-generated results with a human
  managing the workflow — produced by Claude Code (Fable 5, Anthropic);
  external review by GPT 5.6 (OpenAI); two outside Grok (xAI) reports
  adjudicated; see DISCLOSURE.md.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-29
url: "https://github.com/JD-Jones-ASES/Hadamard-M"
